    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFantastic chance to purchase within the town centre, adjacent all amenities and the bonus of excellent sea views!! Bright and spacious 2 bed 2nd floor apartment which has private accessed off Railway Street. Situated over the two top floors, this apartment enjoys unrestricted sea and coastal views from the living room and balcony. The accommodation briefly comprises :- inner hallway on the first floor along with master bedroom ensuite, second bedroom with built in wardrobes, shower room, stairs to living area with large picture windows, fitted kitchen and door to balcony with excellent sea views.\n\nTown centre location adjacent to Balbriggan railway station. All local amenities including excellent shopping facilities, beach schools and a good public transport infrastructure with Bus Eireann, Dublin Bus and Suburban Rail access to Dublin City Centre (c. 45mins.) are only minutes away."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nwith laminate wood flooring\n\nKitchen / Living area - 6.25m x 4.39m\nspacious bright room with balcony off and t.v. point. Kitchen area - modern fitted kitchen, tiled floor & tiled splashback, built-in hob, oven and extractor fan, plumbed for washing machine.\n\nBedroom One - 4.1m x 2.58m\nwith built in wardrobes, t.v. point, door intoEnsuite - with w.c., .wh.b., tiled shower cubicle with shower unit, fully tiled.\n\nBedroom Two - 3.4m x 2.6m\nwith built in wardrobes and laminate wood flooring.\n\nOffice / Study - 1.7m x 2.6.\nwith laminate flooring\n\nShower room - 1.86m x 2.6m\nwith w.c., w.h.b, bath, fully tiled.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Spacious 2 Bed duplex apartment top floor apartment</li><li>Located within a small infill development</li><li>Living room with large picture window with stunning sea views</li><li>Private balcony off the living room overlooking sea and harbour</li><li>Double glazed windows and electric heating</li><li>Master Bedroom with Ensuite and built in wardrobes</li><li>Town Centre Location mins walk to Train Station </li><li>Metres from all amenities including shops, beach, train station, schools.</ul>"
      },
